SDKS:
 - TypeScript: npm install @pierre/sdk
 - Python: pip install pierre-sdk
 - Go: go get github.com/pierrecomputer/sdk/go

[TYPESCRIPT DOCUMENTATION](https://code.storage/docs/sdks/typescript)
[PYTHON DOCUMENTATION](https://code.storage/docs/sdks/python)
[GO DOCUMENTATION](https://code.storage/docs/sdks/go)

~~~

TO USE AGENT SKILLS:

npx skills add pierrecomputer/skills

[AGENT SETUP](https://code.storage/docs/getting-started/agent-setup)

~~~

EARLIER SDKS:

@pierre/storage, pierre-storage, and code-storage-go are the earlier
Code Storage SDKs. @pierre/sdk, pierre-sdk, and
github.com/pierrecomputer/sdk/go replace them. The earlier SDKs get no
new release. Their source stays in packages/.

To move code to the new SDKs, install the pierre-migrate skill with
npx skills add pierrecomputer/skills.

[EARLIER SDK DOCUMENTATION](https://code.storage/docs/sdk/overview)
